#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:1
msgid "openSUSE BuildService - LXDE"
msgstr "ບໍລິການບິວ openSUSE - LXDE"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:2
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:2
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:2
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:2
msgid "Latest LXDE release"
msgstr "ລຸ້ນ LXDE ຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:3
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:3
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:3
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:3
msgid ""
"The LXDE repository in the openSUSE Build Service, which provides you with "
"the unsupported but latest version of the LX desktop environment and "
"software."
msgstr ""
"ຄັງເກັບ LXDE ໃນບໍລິການບິວຂອງ openSUSE, ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ບໍລິການສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ຊອບແວ LX ລຸ້ນ"
"ຫຼ້າສຸດ ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ."

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:4
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:4
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:4
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:4
msgid "openSUSE BuildService - LibreOffice"
msgstr "ບໍລິການບິວ openSUSE - LibreOffice"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:5
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:5
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:5
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:5
msgid "Latest stable LibreOffice release"
msgstr "ລຸ້ນ LibreOffice ທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:6
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:6
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:6
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:6
msgid ""
"Provides you with the latest stable version of LibreOffice, the Office suite "
"that openSUSE uses."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ LibreOffice ລຸ້ນທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງຫຼ້າສຸດ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຊຸດໂປຣແກຣມຫ້ອງການທີ່ openSUSE ນຳໃຊ້."

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:7
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:7
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:7
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:7
msgid "openSUSE BuildService - Mozilla"
msgstr "ບໍລິການບິວ openSUSE - Mozilla"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:8
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:8
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:8
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:8
msgid "Most recent builds of Mozilla Software like Firefox"
msgstr "ຊອບແວ Mozilla ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ຫຼ້າສຸດ ເຊັ່ນ Firefox"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:9
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:9
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:9
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Containing the latest releases of all Mozilla software, such as the popular "
"Thunderbird (mail client), Firefox and SeaMonkey (web browsers)."
msgstr ""
"ລວມມີຊອບແວທັງໝົດຂອງ Mozilla ລຸ້ນຫຼ້າສຸດ ເຊັ່ນ Thunderbird (ໂປຣແກຣມຮັບສົ່ງອີເມວ), Firefox ແລ"
"ະ SeaMonkey (ເວັບບຣາວເຊີ)."

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:10
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:10
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:10
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:10
msgid "openSUSE BuildService - Wine CVS Builds"
msgstr "ບໍລິການບິວ openSUSE - Wine CVS Builds"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:11
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:11
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:11
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:11
msgid "Snapshots of Wine CVS"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດຊົ່ວຄາວຂອງ Wine CVS"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:12
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:12
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:12
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"Wine is an Open Source implementation of the Windows API, so it allows you "
"to run some Windows applications in openSUSE. This repository provides the "
"latest CVS (development) snapshot packages of Wine."
msgstr ""
"Wine ແມ່ນການຈຳລອງ Windows API ແບບໂອເພັນຊອດ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ງານບາງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອ"
"ງ Windows ໃນ openSUSE ໄດ້. ຄັງເກັບນີ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກັດ Wine ລຸ້ນພັດທະນາ (CVS) ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:13
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:13
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:13
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:13
msgid "openSUSE BuildService - Games"
msgstr "ບໍລິການບິວ openSUSE - ເກມ"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:14
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:14
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:14
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:14
msgid "A collection of action games"
msgstr "ລວມຊຸດເກມແອັກຊັນ"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:15
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:15
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:15
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:15
msgid ""
"Contains several action games including Open Arena (shoot 'em up), Flight "
"Gear (flight simulator) and Torcs (3D racing simulator)."
msgstr ""
"ລວມມີເກມແອັກຊັນຫຼາຍເກມ ເຊັ່ນ Open Arena, Flight Gear (ເກມຈຳລອງການບິນ) ແລະ Torcs (ເກມ"
"ຈຳລອງການແຂ່ງລົດ 3D)."

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:16
msgid "openSUSE BuildService - Drivers for webcams"
msgstr "ບໍລິການບິວ openSUSE - ໄດຣເວີສຳລັບເວັບແຄມ"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:17
msgid "Recent drivers for webcams"
msgstr "ໄດຣເວີເວັບແຄມລຸ້ນໃໝ່"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:18
msgid "Contains recent drivers for hundreds of different webcams."
msgstr "ລວມມີໄດຣເວີລຸ້ນໃໝ່ສຳລັບເວັບແຄມຫຼາຍຮ້ອຍລຸ້ນ."

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:19
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:16
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:16
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:16
msgid "openSUSE BuildService - Virtualization (VirtualBox)"
msgstr "ບໍລິການບິວ openSUSE - Virtualization (VirtualBox)"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:20
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:17
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:17
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:17
msgid "Latest builds of Virtualbox"
msgstr "VirtualBox ລຸ້ນຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:21
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:18
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:18
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:18
msgid ""
"Provides up-to-date builds of VirtualBox, a general-purpose open-source full "
"virtualizer for x86 hardware."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ VirtualBox ລຸ້ນໃໝ່, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຊອບແວຈຳລອງລະບົບແບບໂອເພັນຊອດສຳລັບຮາດແວ x86."

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:22
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:19
msgid "openSUSE BuildService - PHP"
msgstr "ບໍລິການບິວ openSUSE - PHP"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:23
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:20
msgid "Latest updates for PHP software"
msgstr "ອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດສຳລັບຊອບແວ PHP"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:24
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:21
msgid ""
"Provides the latest packages and multiple-version builds of PHP software."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກັດຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ ການບິວ PHP ຫຼາຍເວີຊັນ."

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:25
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:22
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:19
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:19
