msgstr "ບໍລິການບິວ openSUSE - ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:26
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:23
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:20
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:20
