msgstr "ອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດສຳລັບຊອບແວຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:27
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:24
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:21
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:21
msgid "Latest updates for database software including Firebird and MySQL."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດສຳລັບຊອບແວຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ລວມທັງ Firebird ແລະ MySQL."

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:28
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:25
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:22
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:22
