#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:26
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:23
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:23
