msgstr "ຄັງເກັບຊຸມຊົນສຳລັບ KDE"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:30
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:27
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:24
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:24
msgid ""
"Provides additional KDE software maintained by the openSUSE KDE community."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊອບແວ KDE ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ດູແລໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ openSUSE KDE."

