msgstr "ແບັກພອດ (Backports) ຂອງແອັບ GNOME"

#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_131_Additional.xml.in:33
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_132_Additional.xml.in:30
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.1_Additional.xml.in:27
#: YaST/Repos/_openSUSE_Leap_42.2_Additional.xml.in:27
msgid ""
"Updates to the GNOME software that is shipped with the distribution "
"(backports)."
msgstr "ອັບເດດສຳລັບຊອບແວ GNOME ທີ່ມາກັບຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງ (ແບັກພອດ)."

